  <Groups>
    <Group elementId="CPLX-1364" textLabel="CPLX-1364" type="Complex">
      <Xref identifier="CPLX-1364" dataSource="plantcyc" />
      <Graphics centerX="150" centerY="455" width="140" height="100" textColor="666666" fontName="Arial" fontSize="10" borderColor="9900CC" borderStyle="Dashed" borderWidth="2.0" fillColor="F5E6FF" shapeType="Rectangle" zOrder="-1" />
      <Comment>ACC synthase is encoded by a gene family of at least 5 genes in Arabidopsis. The genes are differentially expressed during plant development or in response to environmental stimuli. The expression of ACS4 responds to IAA (a auxin). The ACC synthase activity of ACS4 was confirmed by heterologous expression of ACS4 in E.coli.</Comment>
      <Property key="UniqueID" value="CPLX-1364" />
